ream attribution of earlier published versions:\n\n- MIT-only declarations: block2 0.6.2, objc2 0.6.4, objc2-encode 4.1.0, objc2-foundation 0.3.2.\n- Zlib OR Apache-2.0 OR MIT declarations: dispatch2 0.3.1, objc2-app-kit 0.3.2, objc2-core-foundation 0.3.2, objc2-core-graphics 0.3.2, objc2-exception-helper 0.1.1, objc2-io-surface 0.3.2, objc2-web-kit 0.3.2.\n\nThe source revisions associated with these releases predate the added licence files. Are the repository-root texts intended to cover these versions under their respective declared licences? Are there additional copyright notices from earlier upstream code that should accompany them, particularly for the MIT-only crates? A pointer to existing authoritative notices would be very helpful.\n\nThis is not a request for relicensing, crate republishing, or a legal opinion on Apple SDK terms. Thank you.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madsmtm/objc2/issues/comments/6100378501/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madsmtm/objc2/issues/comments/6103078978","html_url":"https://github.com/madsmtm/objc2/issues/826#issuecomment-6103078978","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/madsmtm/objc2/issues/826","id":6103078978,"node_id":"IC_kwDOF-f-W88AAAABa8WYQg","user":{"login":"madsmtm","id":10577181,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTc3MTgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10577181?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsmtm","html_url":"https://github.com/madsmtm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsmtm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsmtm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsmtm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madsmtm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.